 class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>crapcarp</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/864668-lfp-beast-the-primordial-crossover-new-players-welcome-encouraged?p=866723#post866723\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Demon: the Fallen is a World of Darkness game (the older one), not a Chronicles of Darkness game (the newer one). Chronicles Demon is Descent, and it has practically nothing to do with the Underworld as Descent focuses on God-Machine demons, not the traditional Judo-Christian idea of demons described in Fallen. The Underworld in Chronicles is also not the Judo-Christian idea of Hell, but the common idea of being a land of the dead. If you want classic demons and Hell, you might wanna look into the Lower Depths described in the Inferno supplement (though keep in mind, CoD was still called nWoD at the time of publishing).<br /> <br /> As for joining: I might, though you do want players that are new and I'm simply not, nor do I really know of any. It also doesn't help that I don't really have a solid character idea for a Beast.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I know that, but I think Demon: The Fallen fits better storywise than Descent with Beast. I don't like the idea of the God-Machine Demons within the setting, so I decided to use Fallen. I will check out the supplement as well though <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />.<br /> <br /> At the moment - we have a full party so I can't take anyone else. If Space frees up - I will update this thread!<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11457-volke","name":"Volke","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11457_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"127"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-17T17:25:52-07:00","id":867193,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/864668-lfp-beast-the-primordial-crossover-new-players-welcome-encouraged?p=867064#post867064\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This may seem like a silly question, but by name and age, do you mean the name and age of the character or the real person.<br /> <br /> Also, would you allow the use of a homebrew Atavism. I wrote it myself and it's called Ghost in the Machine. It's in the AI Beasts thread.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> At the moment - we have a full party so I can't take anyone else. If Space frees up - I will update this thread! Thank you for your interest though!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11457-volke","name":"Volke","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11457_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"127"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}